{"call_id": "EVAL-CTX-1-b32d", "ani": "+61000000", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "Jane Doe, my birthday is July 22nd, 1990, and I'm under the care of Sydney Heart Centre."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 you\u2019re verified, and I\u2019m here to help with your HeartBug account."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I was told it would take a few days for my order to arrive, but it's been over a week now \u2013 when will it actually get to me?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can see your HeartBug Monitor was delivered on July 8, your Electrode Stickers have shipped and were due July 30, and your Replacement Device is still processing with an August 2 estimate. If you\u2019re asking about a different order or the stickers still haven\u2019t arrived, I can help check next steps or connect you with the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm interested in that Replacement Device \u2013 who's going to deliver it on August 2 like they said?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your HeartBug Replacement Device is still processing, so there isn\u2019t a carrier or tracking number yet, and the current delivery estimate is August 2. If you\u2019d like, I can help check anything else on your HeartBug account or connect you with the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's okay, but how do I track it once it does arrive \u2013 is there some kind of online tracking system or a specific contact person I should reach out to?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "There isn\u2019t an online tracking system or a named contact person I can give you here, but once it\u2019s sent I can help check its status, or I can put you through to the team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "list_orders": 0, "lookup_order": 0, "search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "O1003", "product": "HeartBug Monitor", "status": "delivered", "carrier": "StarTrack", "tracking": "ST1003AU", "eta": "2026-0