{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-b77c", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "I'm just trying to figure out some features on my app, so I don't think we need that information right now."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Of course \u2014 HeartBug doesn\u2019t track your location or personal activities, and it\u2019s only used to connect and upload your ECG data."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's reassuring, but can I record while my screen is off? I like to be active without having to constantly keep an eye on the app."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 if you\u2019re doing a manual recording, HeartBug keeps recording even with the screen off or the app in the background, and it can also work while you\u2019re charging or in airplane mode."}, {"role": "user", "content": "So I'm clear then - does it still work in airplane mode? My phone is going to be out of service for a flight soon and I want to make sure my recordings upload properly later."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 HeartBug can keep recording without your phone, and it will sync back to the app over Bluetooth and upload once your phone has internet again."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What's the price of ten kilos of mango?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can only help with HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can help with your HeartBug account or put you through to the right team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I was just wondering about that because my sister's kid eats a lot of fruit and I need it for his birthday party. Can someone else help me?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely \u2014 I\u2019ll connect you with the HeartBug patient support team now, so please hold for just a moment."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 1}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": []}}
