{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-700f", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "No, actually, I'm just calling with a few questions about using the app and device. What's the process for recording data when my screen is off?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 manual recordings on HeartBug keep running even if your screen is off or the app is in the background."}, {"role": "user", "content": "How does it handle syncing that recorded data with the main app once I turn the screen back on or open it again?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "HeartBug keeps the recording on the device until your phone reconnects by Bluetooth, then it syncs into the app and uploads once your phone has internet, so just keep the app running in the background and don\u2019t force-quit it."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Can I still use the HeartBug device and track my readings if my phone is in airplane mode?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 HeartBug can keep recording without your phone, and it will sync once your phone reconnects in Bluetooth range, so airplane mode on the phone just means the upload waits until Bluetooth and internet are available again."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What's the price of ten kilos of mango?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can only help with HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can help with your HeartBug account or put you through to the right team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 1}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": []}}
