ssary clinical decisions for Mr Thompson's ongoing care?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can confirm Mr Thompson\u2019s enrolment is completed, monitoring runs until 29 July 2026, and his report is ready in HeartBug, but I don\u2019t have any further clinical details beyond that."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "check_patient_status": 0, "check_patient_alerts": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "Alex Thompson"}], "actions": ["caller verified as a doctor"]}}
